# Visual System v2

The current layer governance on top of the current brand foundation. Full source: `design/VISUAL_SYSTEM_V2.md`. Ledger: `docs/SITE-VISUAL-TASKS.md`. Authority tiers and task modes: `design/DESIGN-AUTHORITY.md`.

This does **not** replace `.cursorrules`, `design/BRAND.md`, `DESIGN_SYSTEM.md`, `UX_PRINCIPLES.md`, or `IMAGERY.md`. Huntress-like precision is a **controlled upper layer**, not a new visual direction.

**DE needs more technical precision, visual evidence, and interactivity — but not more visual noise.**

## What in this rule is which tier

- **Tier 0 (every mode):** the truthfulness rules below — classification, no invented telemetry / customers / metrics / incidents / compliance / capabilities, emerald only when genuinely live, no fake pulses.
- **Tier 2 (Maintenance Mode mandatory; Exploration Mode default):** the layer model, the foundation tokens, the HUD yes/no grammar, IconWell on small cards, "vocabulary first", "no new site-wide pattern until an approved primitive exists".
- **Joe-decided Tier 2:** Blog/Journal amber and Store electric + 14 pills (`blog-store-color-lock.mdc`); DE Desk graphite shell (`de-desk-design.mdc`). Maintenance: keep. Exploration: may propose, Joe ships.

Do not touch `ZohoASAPWidget.tsx` unless the ledger or Joe assigns it to you (ownership, not aesthetics).

